<title>USA: Arlington Heights, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Arlington Heights, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings said it won $18.100 million of Arlington Heights, Ill., various general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.81 percent.</p>
</text>
